          <p>用不学,加很多很多钱,直接上 GPT-6-ASTRA,然后当万能许愿机就行了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063290\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 17:22:33 +08:00\">20h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>买点 AI 股票，大数据自然会给你推送</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063298\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5fad/1233/367295_normal.png?m=1775722356\" alt=\"iixy\" data-uid=\"367295\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iixy\">iixy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 17:24:09 +08:00\">20h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只要学得慢，你就不用学</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063318\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4062/6f1e/257375_normal.png?m=1554860639\" alt=\"lucays\" data-uid=\"257375\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lucays\">lucays</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 17:26:50 +08:00\">20h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别跟，一直用最新模型就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 17:49:57 +08:00\">20h 11m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>老板在缓解自己的焦虑罢了，他自己也懒得去学任何跟 AI 有关的东西，更不知道自己要如何重构组织来适应 AI 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063501\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f84a/39bd/329667_normal.png?m=1770729345\" alt=\"zhouweiluan\" data-uid=\"329667\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhouweiluan\">zhouweiluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 18:12:00 +08:00\">19h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>想当年刚开始用生图 AI 的时候，又是得用英文提示词，还分正向提示词反向提示词，还要自己部署本地模型<br>后来又变成要部署一个 SD 的 WebUI ，还分什么 LoRA 模型 checkpoints 模型和大模型<br>后来发展发展又来个 comfyui ，各种节点各种参数要调各种教程涌现。<br>直到现在 Agent 时代，完全颠覆，用自然语言跟 AI 聊就能按想法出图改图，以前花大量金钱大量时间学的各种骚操作全部一夜报废。<br>目前总结就是会打字提需求说话就行，什么都不用学。<br>AI 的发展方向肯定是让人类越来越趋于简单的使用，越来越趋于低门槛，只要一个东西你现在看着感觉很复杂很麻烦那就完全不用学，交给时间去让 AI 进化。<br>现在花大量心思学了，过几个月又是一个大颠覆，白学。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063573\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td>